      "lineage": {
        "description": "INFORM Colombia aggregates multiple datasets from various sources to calculate a composite humanitarian risk index at municipal level using the formula Risk = Hazard × Vulnerability × Lack of Coping Capacity. The dataset includes separate components for hazard (AMENAZA), vulnerability (VULNERABILIDAD), and response capacity (FALTA DE CAPACIDAD DE RESPUESTA), integrated into overall risk scores that track temporal changes in crisis probability.",
